    "lyrics": {
      "text": "O_ all-ho-ly The--o-to-kos, do thou not a-ban-don me for as long as I live; do thou not en-trust me to an-y hu-man__ pro-tec-tion, but do thou thy-self de-fend and have mer--cy on me.__\n\nUn-to thee do I com-mit mine eve-ry hope, O Moth--er of God; guard me un--der thy shel--ter.___"
